NOTE ON SCOPE

The MIT terms above cover the SOFTWARE in this repository: the scoring engines
(instrument/scoring.py, instrument/scoring.js), the test suite, and the analysis
scripts under analysis/.

The INSTRUMENT itself -- the item wording, dimension structure, weights, band
definitions and action plans in instrument/bank_v1.json -- is released under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Neither licence extends to the survey microdata the analysis runs on. The UK
Cyber Security Breaches Survey and Cyber Security Longitudinal Survey are
distributed by the UK Data Service under an End User Licence that forbids
redistribution; no such data is included here. See data/README.md.
